# FlightWay prototype workflow

`Jacob_Work` is the prototype branch. It deploys to `flightway-prototype` via CI.

When you finish implementing an approved plan or complete FlightWay feature/fix work:

1. Run verification (`node --check` on touched JS, `bash scripts/smoke.sh` when applicable).
2. Commit with a clear message.
3. Push to `origin/Jacob_Work` — do not leave implemented work only local.

Only skip push if the user explicitly says not to.
